{"text":"If you choose to use your status and influence to raise your voice on behalf of those who have no voice, if you choose to identify not only with the powerful but with the powerless, if you retain the ability to imagine yourself into the lives of those who do not have your advantages, then it will not only be your proud families who celebrate your existence, but thousands and millions of people whose reality you have helped change. We do not need magic to transform our world. We carry all the power we need inside ourselves already. We have the power to imagine better. I am nearly finished. I have one last hope for you, which is something that I already had at 21.","words":[{"text":"If","start":0.0,"end":0.82},{"text":"you","start":0.82,"end":1.0},{"text":"choose","start":1.0,"end":1.34},{"text":"to","start":1.34,"end":1.64},{"text":"use","start":1.64,"end":1.8},{"text":"your","start":1.8,"end":2.04},{"text":"status","start":2.04,"end":2.5},{"text":"and","start":2.5,"end":2.82},{"text":"influence","start":2.82,"end":3.32},{"text":"to","start":3.32,"end":3.58},{"text":"raise","start":3.58,"end":3.74},{"text":"your","start":3.74,"end":3.94},{"text":"voice","start":3.94,"end":4.18},{"text":"on","start":4.18,"end":4.36},{"text":"behalf","start":4.36,"end":4.62},{"text":"of","start":4.62,"end":4.82},{"text":"those","start":4.82,"end":4.98},{"text":"who","start":4.98,"end":5.2},{"text":"have","start":5.2,"end":5.4},{"text":"no","start":5.4,"end":5.68},{"text":"voice","start":5.68,"end":6.02,"punct":","},{"text":"if","start":6.66,"end":6.78},{"text":"you","start":6.78,"end":6.98},{"text":"choose","start":6.98,"end":7.28},{"text":"to","start":7.28,"end":7.58},{"text":"identify","start":7.58,"end":8.22},{"text":"not","start":8.22,"end":8.8},{"text":"only","start":8.8,"end":9.16},{"text":"with","start":9.16,"end":9.36},{"text":"the","start":9.36,"end":9.48},{"text":"powerful","start":9.48,"end":9.86},{"text":"but","start":9.86,"end":10.34},{"text":"with","start":10.34,